# VIQ Map / RISQ — example environment configuration
#
# This file is documentation only. No .env file exists at the repo root
# today; the running app currently gets OPENAI_API_KEY (and friends) from
# real shell/container environment variables. Copy this to `.env` only if
# you want to switch to file-based config locally — doing so is additive
# and will not break the existing VIQ startup path.

# ===== Required (existing VIQ behavior — unchanged) =====
OPENAI_API_KEY=
OPENAI_MODEL=gpt-4o-mini
OPENAI_EMBEDDING_MODEL=text-embedding-3-small
API_HOST=0.0.0.0
API_PORT=8000
LOG_LEVEL=INFO

# ===== Optional — RISQ module =====
# All of these already have safe defaults in app/config.py, so nothing
# below needs to be set for RISQ to work out of the box.
# RISQ_SIMILARITY_THRESHOLD=0.3
# RISQ_MAX_UPLOAD_MB=25
# RISQ_DEFAULT_TOP_K=3
